{"id":"npc:%E5%A4%A7%E7%86%8A","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"乌萨斯人，雪怪小队成员之一。","spoiler":true,"source":"主线剧情6-12 冰原之雪。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_npc_037_2.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/f/f6/Avg_avg_npc_037_2.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_037_2.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"obt/main/level_main_06-11_beg","lineCount":5,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":14,"line":15,"speaker":"大熊","text":"荒原上会出现一条河流……一条逃难者的河流。"},{"commandIndex":15,"line":16,"speaker":"大熊","text":"既有乌萨斯人，也有龙门人。既有感染者，也有普通人。来时他们或贫或富，去时他们两手空空。"},{"commandIndex":281,"line":282,"speaker":"大熊","text":"说到做到！"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_06-13_end","lineCount":1,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":234,"line":235,"speaker":"大熊","text":"没有。"}]}]}